msgstr "**Opruimen en opnieuw instellen**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup Mode**: Removes the wildcard config file when `CERTBOT_FLAVOR` is set to `dedicated` and `MODE_CLEANUP` is enabled. 🗑️"
msgstr "**Opruimmodus**: Verwijdert het wildcard configuratiebestand wanneer `CERTBOT_FLAVOR` is ingesteld op `dedicated` en `MODE_CLEANUP` is ingeschakeld. 🗑️"

# translated-by: libretranslate
