# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Social Network:** Connects with other BookWyrm instances and ActivityPub platforms."
msgstr "**Federated Social Network:** Verbindingen met andere BookWyrm instanties en ActivityPub platforms."

# translated-by: libretranslate
