msgstr "**Inventaris & pakhuis:** Beheer voorraadniveaus, transfers en magazijnactiviteiten. Ondersteunt barcode scannen, batch picking, en geavanceerde routing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Inventarismappen.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) oproepen [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), die maakt een map per ronde op `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (of gewoon `<inventory-dir>` wanneer er één ronde is). Voor elke map, `build_dev_inventory` lost de ronde per-app variant lading en bakt het in de inventaris's `host_vars` als `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` Overschrijft. De inventaris is daarom variant-opgelost op schijf; er is geen runtime selector nodig."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory pin**: set `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` in `group_vars` or `host_vars` of the target environment."
msgstr "**Inventarispen**: ingesteld `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` in `group_vars` of `host_vars` van de doelomgeving."

# translated-by: libretranslate
