# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Powerful Search:** Full-text and structured search to quickly find knowledge across spaces."
msgstr "**Krachtig zoeken:** Full-text en gestructureerde zoekopdracht om snel kennis te vinden in ruimtes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
