# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both are read from the variant-merged applications view, so a variant that drops the opt-in drops the forward with it. The published port binds the host interface, so the loopback target reaches it from svc-net-tor's host-network container. Composed with the flagged forwards by ``lookup('tor_extra_ports')`` and rendered as ``HiddenServicePort`` lines in svc-net-tor's torrc."
msgstr "Beiden worden gelezen uit de variant-samengevoegde applicaties weergave, dus een variant die de opt-in daalt de opt-in daalt de voorkant mee. De gepubliceerde poort bindt de host interface, zodat de loopback doel bereikt van svc-net-tor's host-netwerk container. Samengesteld met de gemarkeerde forwards door ``lookup('tor_extra_ports')`` en als ``HiddenServicePort`` lijnen in svc-net-tor's Torrc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both are used as central defaults for every app role."
msgstr "Beide worden gebruikt als centrale standaard voor elke app rol."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. The dashboard’s entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side ``oidc.js`` bundle, and ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` in ``vars/main.yml`` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Beide authentieke Playwright persona's worden geblokkeerd terwijl ``services.sso.enabled`` is vals. Het dashboard is volledig Keycloak integratie is de browser-kant ``oidc.js`` bundel, en ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` in ``vars/main.yml`` dat bestand alleen verscheept als SSO is ingeschakeld, dus met SSO off the page wordt noch een login link, noch een logout control weergegeven."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. Without SSO, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` skips the ``auth_by_http_header`` snippet, so the OMD site falls back to its own login form."
msgstr "Beide authentieke Playwright persona's worden geblokkeerd terwijl ``services.sso.enabled`` is vals. Zonder SSO, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` slaat de ``auth_by_http_header`` Snippet, dus de OMD-site valt terug op zijn eigen login."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while `services.sso.enabled` is false. The dashboard's entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side `oidc.js` bundle, and `DASHBOARD_JS_FILES` in `vars/main.yml` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Beide authentieke Playwright persona's worden geblokkeerd terwijl `services.sso.enabled` is vals. Het dashboard is compleet. Keycloak integratie is de browser-kant `oidc.js` bundel, en `DASHBOARD_JS_FILES` in `vars/main.yml` dat bestand alleen verscheept als SSO is ingeschakeld, dus met SSO off the page wordt noch een login link, noch een logout control weergegeven."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while `services.sso.enabled` is false. Without SSO, `files/configure-sso.sh` skips the `auth_by_http_header` snippet, so the OMD site falls back to its own login form."
msgstr "Beide authentieke Playwright persona's worden geblokkeerd terwijl `services.sso.enabled` is vals. Zonder SSO, `files/configure-sso.sh` slaat de `auth_by_http_header` Snippet, dus de OMD-site valt terug op zijn eigen login."

