# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "On Windows, use [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) as the development environment and run the repository commands inside WSL2, not directly in [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Use Ubuntu 24.04 with [Docker Desktop WSL2 integration](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), enable [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), and expect a few Windows-specific follow-up steps around [certificate authority (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) trust and local name resolution."
msgstr "Gebruik op Windows [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) als de ontwikkelomgeving en voer de repository commando's binnen WSL2, niet rechtstreeks in [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Ubuntu gebruiken 24.04 met [Docker Desktop WSL2 integratie](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), inschakelen [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), en verwachten een paar Windows-specifieke follow-up stappen rond [certificaatautoriteit (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) vertrouwen en lokale naamresolutie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
