msgstr "Het CLI-toegangspunt woont op [ main .py](../../cli/meta/env/__main__.py) onder `cli/meta/env/`. Shell consumenten bron [load.sh](../../scripts/meta/env/load.sh) onder `scripts/meta/env/`."

