msgstr "De configurerende Nextcloud apps worden opgegeven in ``meta/addons/`` krachtens het uniforme addon-contract (eis 026). Elke verklaring draagt zijn volledige ``occ config:app:set`` laadvermogen onder ``config:``. De enable-only appstore apps blijven onder ``nextcloud.plugins`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`- Ja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The config-bearing Nextcloud apps are declared in `meta/addons/` under the unified addon contract (requirement 026). Each declaration carries its full `occ config:app:set` payload under `config:`. The enable-only appstore apps stay under `nextcloud.plugins` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)."
msgstr "De configurerende Nextcloud apps worden opgegeven in `meta/addons/` krachtens het uniforme addon-contract (eis 026). Elke verklaring draagt zijn volledige `occ config:app:set` laadvermogen onder `config:`. De enable-only appstore apps blijven onder `nextcloud.plugins` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The configured entries, or an empty mapping where no inventory answers, as in the dev stack."
msgstr "De geconfigureerde ingangen, of een lege mapping waar geen inventaris antwoorden, zoals in de dev stack."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The configured relay host, the loopback address, the container's alias for its host, or a swarm manager."
msgstr "De geconfigureerde relais host, de loopback adres, de container alias voor de host, of een zwerm manager."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The constructor stage renders once through the [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) action and parks the result together with its cache key in the host fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (the action calls `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`). Every later worker inherits that fact at fork time; `get_merged_applications` serves it whenever the key still matches and renders only when it does not (a changed `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` or `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."
msgstr "De constructeur scoort eenmaal door de [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) actie en parkeert het resultaat samen met de cache sleutel in het gast feit `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (de actie roept `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`). Elke latere werknemer erft dat feit op vorktijd; `get_merged_applications` dient het wanneer de sleutel nog steeds overeenkomt en rendert alleen als het niet (a veranderd `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` of `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that `/metrics` is reachable at the documented path (where applicable). Prometheus admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer `up=1` verification live in `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only, parameterised over `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."
msgstr "De rol van de consument stelt alleen dat `/metrics` is bereikbaar op het gedocumenteerde pad (indien van toepassing). Prometheus admin-reach, biber denial en per consument `up=1` controle live in `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` alleen, geparametriseerd over `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that the matomo tracking snippet is in the HTML and that navigation generates the expected `/matomo.php` request (covered by `assertCspInjections` in the persona-helper). Matomo admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer tracker-site registration live in `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only."
msgstr "De rol van de consument stelt alleen dat de matomo tracking knipsel is in de HTML en dat navigatie genereert de verwachte `/matomo.php` verzoek (gedekt door `assertCspInjections` in de persona-helper). Matomo admin-reach, biber ontkenning, en per consument tracker-site registratie live in `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Alleen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role's spec does NOT exercise the dashboard tile. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parameterises one tile-reachability test per consumer over `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and delegates the body to `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` from the sibling `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (tile visibility, click → `#main iframe` embed, header \"Tab\" button → new browser tab). Consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any tile / iframe / tab assertions."
msgstr "De spec van de consumentenrol oefent de dashboardtegel NIET uit. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parametereert één tegel-reachability test per consument over `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` en delegeert het lichaam aan `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` van de broer en zus `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (tegelzicht, klik op → `#main iframe` inbed, kop \"Tab\" knop → nieuw browsertabblad). De specificaties van de consument mogen geen tegel / iframe / tab beweringen opnieuw uitvoeren."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The consumer's ``services.<engine>`` block (or empty)."
msgstr "De consument ``services.<engine>`` blok (of leeg)."

