# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "De generieke playwright biber en administrator persona's worden geblokkeerd via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` en `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Artikel 11 expliciete opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is een mobiele-first SPA wiens logout / account control zit achter een profiel menu de auth-oppervlakte controle kan niet bereiken. Op maat \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky sessie in social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test en de LDAP-variant in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` beide personen correct verifiëren (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is aanwezig na de overdracht van de makelaar). Zodra een stabiele selector voor het social-app profiel menu stroomopwaarts landt, laat de opt-outs vallen en laat de persona helpers het dashboard → app → afmelden reis end-to-end."

