# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The orchestrator and the push entry workflow (`entry-push-latest.yml`) cancel in-progress runs on every ref except `main`, which no automatic trigger cancels. A `pull_request_target` run inherits `refs/heads/main` as its ref, so the orchestrator does not cancel there either; per-PR supersession is handled by the entry workflow's own `pr-ci-*` group. See [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "De orkestrator en de push entry workflow (`entry-push-latest.yml`) Voortgangen op elke ref annuleren behalve `main`, die geen automatische trigger annuleert. A `pull_request_target` erfstukken uitvoeren `refs/heads/main` als zijn ref, zodat de orkestmeester er ook niet annuleer; per-PR supersession wordt behandeld door de entry workflow eigen `pr-ci-*` Groep. Zie [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The orchestrator runs the following stages in order:"
msgstr "De orkestmeester leidt de volgende etappes in volgorde:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
