# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `sso.shared` to `false`, and the role ships no `meta/users.yml` and no account provisioning; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) only configures the build service. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the `biber` or `administrator` persona, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "De rol publiceert een openbare documentatie site. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pennen `sso.enabled` en `sso.shared` tot `false`, en de rol schepen geen `meta/users.yml` en geen boekhouding; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) configureert alleen de bouwservice. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) alleen de container en proxy stack bedraden en de Sphinx tooling in de build context stagen. Er is geen rekening en geen echte keten voor de `biber` of `administrator` persona, dus. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declareert `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` en `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. De `guest` persona en de uitgangssituatie bereikbaarheid en CSP beweringen lopen onvoorwaardelijk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "De rol publiceert een openbare documentatie site. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona en de uitgangssituatie bereikbaarheid en CSP beweringen lopen onvoorwaardelijk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders ``settings.yml`` from the deployment’s own secret key and mounts it read-only. ``formats`` carries ``json`` next to ``html``, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "De rol geeft ``settings.yml`` vanuit de implementatie zijn eigen geheime sleutel en mount het alleen-lezen. ``formats`` draagt ``json`` naast ``html``, omdat een machine consument krijgt HTTP 403 op het JSON-eindpunt anders, en de snelheidsbegrenzing is uitgeschakeld omdat de enige clients platformdiensten op het containernetwerk zijn."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders `settings.yml` from the deployment's own secret key and mounts it read-only. `formats` carries `json` next to `html`, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "De rol geeft `settings.yml` vanaf de eigen geheime sleutel van de implementatie en monteert het alleen-lezen. `formats` draagt `json` naast `html`, omdat een machine consument krijgt HTTP 403 op het JSON-eindpunt anders, en de snelheidsbegrenzing is uitgeschakeld omdat de enige clients platformdiensten op het containernetwerk zijn."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the `-full` image, which carries the OCR and language packs, and serves it on port 9998 inside the container network only. No port is published and no proxy entry is created."
msgstr "De rol van de `-full` afbeelding, die de OCR en taalpakketten, en dient het op poort 9998 alleen binnen het containernetwerk. Er wordt geen poort gepubliceerd en er wordt geen proxy-invoer aangemaakt."

