# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. web-app-hugo serves a statically built site: `services.sso` is hard-disabled in `meta/services.yml`, the container is a Hugo build baked into nginx (`templates/compose.yml.j2`), and the Playwright env file renders no `ADMIN_*` / `BIBER_*` credentials. There is no session, no admin surface and no logout control to drive, so the `guest` persona plus the reachability, CSP and rendered-HTML assertions are the complete contract for this role."
msgstr "De gedeelde `biber` en `administrator` persona reizen worden gekozen via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` ' `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. web-app-hugo dient een statisch gebouwde site: `services.sso` is hard uitgeschakeld in `meta/services.yml`, de container is een Hugo build baked in nginx (`templates/compose.yml.j2`), en het Playwright env bestand geeft geen `ADMIN_*` ' `BIBER_*` referenties. Er is geen sessie, geen admin oppervlak en geen uitlog controle om te rijden, dus de `guest` persona plus de bereikbaarheid, CSP en HTML beweringen zijn het volledige contract voor deze rol."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` persona journey is opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. A Jellyfin account binds to exactly one authentication provider, so biber's login is owned by the per-addon specs that know which provider is live: `files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js` for OIDC and `addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js` for the LDAP-only matrix variant. The generic persona cannot pick between them and would duplicate or contradict that coverage; `playwright.spec.js` keeps the `guest` scenario and the native administrator login."
msgstr "De gedeelde `biber` persona reis wordt gekozen via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. A Jellyfin account bindt aan precies één authenticatieprovider, zodat de login van biber eigendom is van de per-addon specificaties die weten welke provider live is: `files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js` voor OIDC en `addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js` voor de LDAP-alleen-matrixvariant. De generieke persona kan niet tussen hen kiezen en zou deze dekking dupliceren of tegenspreken; `playwright.spec.js` houdt de `guest` scenario en de native beheerder login."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `default.json.j2` MUST stay generic. App-specific protocol mappers, claims, or scopes MUST NOT be added there because the change affects every other client."
msgstr "De gedeelde `default.json.j2` Moet generiek blijven. App-specifiek protocol mappers, claims, of scopes MOET NIET daar worden toegevoegd omdat de verandering van invloed is op elke andere client."

