msgstr "Deze Ansible rol installeert de [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop client op Arch Linux systemen met behulp van de [AUR (Arch User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
