# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the iteration loops agents follow while driving a role end to end: the [Compose Loop](compose.md), the [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), the [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md), the [Workflow Loop](workflow.md), and the cross-mode [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md) gate that runs compose then swarm. Its scope is the mechanics of those loops."
msgstr "Deze map bevat de iteratie loops agenten volgen tijdens het besturen van een rol einde aan einde: de [Loop samenstellen](compose.md), de [Zwermlus](swarm.md), de [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md), de [Werkstroomlus](workflow.md), en de dwarsstand [Afrondingslus](roundtrip.md) Poort die loopt componeert dan zwerm. Het toepassingsgebied is de mechanica van die lussen."

