msgid "This page covers integration testing requirements, framework, and structure. Run integration tests with `make test-integration`."
msgstr "Deze pagina behandelt integratie testen eisen, kader, en structuur. Integratietests uitvoeren met `make test-integration`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers regression-guard rules in tests. For general integration-test requirements and structure, see [Integration Tests](integration.md)."
