# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Deze rol wordt ingezet **Shopware 6** gebruik **Docker**. Het automatiseert installatie, migratie en configuratie van uw storefront, integreren met een centrale **MariaDB** database. Optionele onderdelen zoals **Redis** en **OpenZoeken** verbetering van prestaties en zoekmogelijkheden, terwijl **OIDC** integreert de administratie backend met **Keycloak**. Directory accounts op dezelfde manier aanmelden: Shopware heeft geen admin-LDAP uitbreiding deze rol kan installeren, zodat LDAP identiteiten komen door Keycloak's gebruikersfederatie in plaats van via een eigen plugin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
