# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role force-installs the following Chromium browser extensions via managed Enterprise Policies. They are declared in ``meta/addons/`` and rendered into the CRX install list."
msgstr "Deze rol force-installeert het volgende Chromium browserextensies via beheerd Enterprise Policies. Zij worden in ``meta/addons/`` en weergegeven in de CRX installatielijst."

# translated-by: libretranslate
