# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS (Your Own URL Shortener) is an open‑source URL shortening solution that enables you to create, track, and manage short links with ease. This deployment leverages Docker to provide a secure and easily scalable environment, ensuring that your YOURLS instance is configured for optimal performance and reliability."
msgstr "JEUGD (Uw eigen URL-verkorter) is een open-source URL-verkortende oplossing waarmee u snel korte links kunt maken, volgen en beheren. Deze implementatie heft Docker om een veilige en gemakkelijk schaalbare omgeving, ervoor te zorgen dat uw YOURLS instance is geconfigureerd voor optimale prestaties en betrouwbaarheid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "YOURLS heeft geen eigen SSO; de admin sessie wordt geslagen uit de oauth2-proxy identity header door de ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona blijft live en oefent de brug einde aan einde."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "YOURLS heeft geen eigen SSO; de admin sessie wordt geslagen uit de oauth2-proxy identity header door de `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), die de header alleen eert op de gated admin pad en alleen voor leden van de YOURLS Beheerdersgroep. De poort zelf geeft alleen diezelfde RBAC groep toe ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), dus `biber` is afgewezen voor YOURLS Geeft alles: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declareert `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, en de ontkenning wordt uitdrukkelijk door `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. De `administrator` persona blijft live en oefent de brug einde aan einde."

# translated-by: libretranslate
