# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Geheimen en geheime URL-componenten ontbreken in logs, gegenereerde niet-geheime configuratie, API antwoorden, taakuitvoer, Playwright sporen, en uitzondering tekst. **Drie van de zes oppervlakken worden statisch gehouden:** logs en taakuitvoer door [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), dat vereist `no_log` of `mask_values` op elke MCP-taak die zowel een geheim als afdrukken behandelt; Playwright sporen door [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), die een `playwright.env.j2` van rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` geheim of a `key_credential` URL-component. Gegenereerde niet-geheime configuratie vereist een geheime/niet-geheime classificatie van weergegeven bestanden die nog niet bestaan; API-antwoorden en uitzonderingstekst zijn runtime observaties voor de implementatiefase."

