msgstr "[ ] Controleer back-channel uitloggen van Keycloak beëindigt de OpenCloud sessie in een echte browser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When OIDC is enabled, the role creates the Keycloak `administrator` as an external Semaphore admin at deploy time (`semaphore user add --admin --external`, matching `preferred_username` + email), so the OIDC callback elevates that operator to admin (verified for the `administrator` persona). Upstream has no native claim→admin mapping; this deploy-time external-admin seed is the documented smallest reconciliation step (README)."
msgstr "[ ] Wanneer OIDC is ingeschakeld, de rol creëert de Keycloak `administrator` als externe Semafore admin op inzettijd (`semaphore user add --admin --external`, matching `preferred_username` + e-mail), dus de OIDC callback verhoogt die operator naar admin (gecontroleerd voor de `administrator` persona). Upstream heeft geen native claim→admin mapping; deze implementatie-time extern-admin seed is de gedocumenteerde kleinste verzoeningsstap (README)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When SSO is enabled, the oauth2-proxy gate fronts Checkmk and authenticates against Keycloak (client auto-provisioned via the `redirect_uris` filter)."
msgstr "[ ] Als SSO is ingeschakeld, de oauth2-proxy gate fronten Checkmk en authenticeert tegen Keycloak (klant automatisch voorzien via de `redirect_uris` filter)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ENABLE=true` plus `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SERVER` (host:port), `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_BIND_DN` / `_BIND_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_DN` / `_SEARCH_FILTER`, and the `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_*` attributes are rendered from the central LDAP vars (env names per the v2.x config schema)."
msgstr "[ ] Wanneer `svc-db-openldap` is `group_names`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ENABLE=true` plus `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SERVER` (host:port), `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_BIND_DN` ' `_BIND_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_DN` ' `_SEARCH_FILTER`, en `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_*` attributen worden weergegeven van de centrale LDAP vars (env namen per v2.x configuratieschema)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, an LDAP connection is provisioned (`files/configure-sso.sh`) so LDAP users (matching the `X-Remote-User`) exist with roles/contact groups. LDAP is a backend identity source behind the oauth2 gate — there is no separate LDAP login surface, so it is exempted from a Playwright gate (`# nocheck: playwright-service-flag`), mirroring [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."
msgstr "[ ] Wanneer `svc-db-openldap` is `group_names`, een LDAP verbinding is voorzien (`files/configure-sso.sh`) dus LDAP-gebruikers (de `X-Remote-User`) bestaan met rollen/contactgroepen. LDAP is een backend-identiteitsbron achter de oauth2 gate (`# nocheck: playwright-service-flag`), spiegelen [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When `web-app-keycloak` is in `group_names`, the Keycloak OIDC client for Semaphore is auto-provisioned with redirect URI `https://semaphore.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/api/auth/oidc/keycloak/redirect`."
msgstr "[ ] Wanneer `web-app-keycloak` is `group_names`, de Keycloak OIDC-client voor Semafore wordt automatisch voorzien van redirect-URI `https://semaphore.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/api/auth/oidc/keycloak/redirect`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
