# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) is a free, open-source media server. The official `jellyfin/jellyfin` container is Debian-based, stores everything in an internal SQLite DB (**no external database**), and persists three volumes: `/config`, `/cache`, `/media`."
msgstr "[Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) is een vrije, open-source mediaserver. De ambtenaar `jellyfin/jellyfin` container is Debian-gebaseerd, slaat alles op in een interne SQLite DB (**geen externe database**), en blijft drie delen: `/config`, `/cache`, `/media`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) is a free, open-source media server. This role deploys the official `jellyfin/jellyfin` container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy, with Keycloak OIDC (web) and central LDAP authentication provisioned via the Jellyfin auth plugins."
msgstr "[Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) is een vrije, open-source mediaserver. Deze rol zet de ambtenaar in `jellyfin/jellyfin` container achter de Infinito.Nexus omgekeerde proxy, met Keycloak OIDC (web) en centrale LDAP-authenticatie voorzien via de Jellyfin Auth plugins."

