msgid "`ansible` (default) wraps [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from `services.matrix.*` knobs, and disables MDAD's bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "`ansible` (standaard) wraps [matrix-docker-ansible-deployed](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD)MDAD draait70 stroomopwaarts sub-rollen te leveren Synapse, Element, elke ondersteunde brug, Element Call, en Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pinnen MDAD door commit, maakt een MDAD inventaris van `services.matrix.*` knoppen, en schakelt MDAD's gebundelde Traefik / Postgres / Redis Dus de centrale Infinito diensten back the stack."

