# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`biber` only ever exists inside EspoCRM through OIDC auto-provisioning (`ESPOCRM_CONFIG_OIDC_CREATE_USER=true`, [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); the role itself seeds only the administrator account. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that provisioning path is gone and no native `biber` user exists, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` and `guest` personas run in every variant."
msgstr "`biber` bestaat alleen maar binnenin EspoCRM door OIDC auto-provisioning (`ESPOCRM_CONFIG_OIDC_CREATE_USER=true`, [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); de rol zelf zorgt alleen voor de beheerdersrekening. In de `services.sso.enabled: false` matrixvarianten die voorzien pad is verdwenen en geen inheemse `biber` gebruiker bestaat, dus [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. De `administrator` en `guest` personages lopen in elke variant."

