msgid "`init.py` writes the inventory; `deploy/cli.py` decides which application ids to hand to `cli.administration.deploy.dedicated`. Both derive their per-round set from the same `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` closure and MUST apply the same `prune_orphans_after_disable` cut with the same round-merged services map. `validate_application_ids` rejects any id that is absent from the inventory, so a deploy-side set wider than the init-side set aborts the run before the first role deploys."
