# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`playwright.spec.js` — orchestrator: TLS baseline, project creation, image asset upload, and the `guest`/`biber`/`administrator` personas. The `biber` / `administrator` personas are declared blocked via `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` (mirroring `web-app-taiga`): Penpot's in-app \"OpenID\" entry and SPA user-menu logout aren't driveable by the generic persona helper, so both users' real auth is exercised by the dedicated login companions above."
msgstr "`playwright.spec.js` `guest`'`biber`'`administrator` personages. De `biber` ' `administrator` personages worden geblokkeerd verklaard via `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` (spiegelen `web-app-taiga`): Penpot's in-app \"OpenID\" entry en SPA gebruikersmenu-uitloggen zijn niet verplaatsbaar door de generische persona helper, zodat de echte auth van beide gebruikers wordt uitgeoefend door de dedicated login metgezellen hierboven."

# translated-by: libretranslate
