# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "a YAML mapping that mirrors the assembled application payload, so it can override anything reachable under `applications.<app>.<root>` (see [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md)). Every root is the name of a `meta/` topic — `services`, `server`, `rbac`, `volumes`, `secrets`, `addons`, `csp`, `domains`, `networks`, `info`, `users` — because the entry is baked into `host_vars` raw, which makes its top-level key the inventory path. A key no `meta/<topic>.yml` produces lands where nothing reads it and the override is silently discarded; `TestVariantTopLevelKeys` in [test_layout.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_layout.py) rejects it."
msgstr "een YAML mapping die de verzamelde toepassing payload spiegelt, zodat het alles bereikbaar onder `applications.<app>.<root>` (zie [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md)). Elke wortel is de naam van een `meta/` onderwerp `services`, `server`, `rbac`, `volumes`, `secrets`, `addons`, `csp`, `domains`, `networks`, `info`, `users` Omdat de ingang wordt gebakken in `host_vars` rauw, waardoor zijn top-niveau sleutel de voorraad pad. Een sleutel geen `meta/<topic>.yml` brengt land voort waar niets het leest en de overreding wordt in stilte verworpen. `TestVariantTopLevelKeys` in [test_layout.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_layout.py) verwerpt het."

