msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd's enige HTTP-oppervlak is `ejabberd_web_admin` op `/admin` (zie [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Het authenticeert een kale JID tegen LDAP over HTTP Basic, dus er is geen Keycloak omleiden naar volgen en geen in-app logout controle om te klikken; client authenticatie zelf draait over poorten 5222'5269 en blijft buiten de Playwright lus, zoals vermeld onder Watch Points. `acl.admin` bovendien bevat alleen de beheerder JID, zodat de web admin weigert elke andere account rechtstreeks. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Daarom verklaart `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` en `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona en de basale bereikbaarheid beweringen lopen onvoorwaardelijk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is het enige Playwright-testbare oppervlak; XMPP client login zelf loopt over 5222'5269 EN MOET door een XMPP-een ervaren klant buiten de testlus van Playwright."

