# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "pgAdmin's own login id is the account e-mail `PGADMIN_DEFAULT_EMAIL` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)), not the Keycloak `administrator` username, so the `administrator` persona has no in-app credential once it is through the oauth2-proxy. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) additionally admits only the `web-app-pgadmin` administrator RBAC group to that proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list, so it is denied before pgAdmin is reached. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "pgAdmin's eigen login id is de account e-mail `PGADMIN_DEFAULT_EMAIL` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)), niet de Keycloak `administrator` gebruikersnaam, dus de `administrator` persona heeft geen in-app credential zodra het door de oauth2- Proxy. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) Bovendien geeft alleen de `web-app-pgadmin` beheerder RBAC groep naar die proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`)en `biber` draagt een lege rollenlijst, dus het wordt geweigerd voordat pgAdmin wordt bereikt. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Daarom verklaart `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` en `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona en de basisaantijgingen lopen onvoorwaardelijk."

